      "status": "completed",
      "evidence": "lease_source=git_common_dir。LT-SCHED-004 の active lease (expires 2099) で正しくブロック。LT-SCHED-006 の stale lease (expires 2020) は無視され ready-set に復帰。C17 verifier PASS。"
